-number' style='font-size: {{ pn_size }}'>{{ pn }}</div>\n  <div class='barcode'>\n    <img src='{{ get_barcode_image(doc.partscape_barcode or doc.part_number or doc.item_code, width=306, height=180) }}' alt='' />\n  </div>\n</div>"
